# --- Model checkpoints: deliberately NOT ignored ---
# `inference/model_loader.py` resolves
#   <backend>/models/EfficientNetB0_CFP_final.pth
#   <backend>/models/EfficientNetB0_UWF_final.pt
# from `__file__`, so a Render build of `rootDir: backend` finds them only if they
# are committed. Do NOT add `*.pt`, `*.pth` or `models/` to this file: without the
# weights /predict and /gradcam answer 503 model_unavailable on every fresh clone.
# The root .gitignore ignores `backend/models/*` and re-includes exactly these two
# files (and models/.gitkeep); everything else in that directory stays ignored.